  "description": "Poolside Laguna XS 2.1 DFlash track: optimize target-verified block decode driven by the organizer-provisioned DFlash draft model (a separate ~881 MB EAGLE-style speculator: 5 sliding-window layers, block size 16, conditioned on target hidden states, borrowing the target embedding and lm_head). The drafter and target weights are fixed; the editable surface is the drafting/verification runtime -- block dispatch, multi-row verification kernels, KV rollback, and cache handling. Decode-only paired scoring against the trusted serial K=1 target oracle, with parent-owned token fidelity verification.",
